core joypad-bouncing-off
# Written by hand for the languages, and for the compact text, whose pages are fewer: load.route's keys open the file
# before Lynna's shop, then the cook below Link is talked to (A, with a tap to the right that turns Link to the fence
# once the text is closed, whatever its pages), the sign of the Maku Tree read, the inventory opened, and in the shop
# the bombs taken to the counter: their name, their price and the choice OK or No, then the shopkeeper's answer (the
# bombs are full: they go back).
